//! Every item bota carries as Dota's `scripts/npc/items.txt` has it, at Dota 7.41f's numbers:
//! Dota's internal names and numbers only. Generated by `tools/import_items`; do not edit, run
//! the tool.
//!
//! Read from client 6969 (Oct 27 2026).
//!
//! Where 7.41f is not the install (`tools/import_items/src/overrides.rs`):
//! - `item_ward_dispenser` Cooldown 1.0: Liquipedia, Observer and Sentry Wards, changelog (2017): "Fixed Plant cooldown not working"; the dispenser waits the one second the wards wait between plantings (items.txt gives it none)

